  <!-- App-owned copies of SDK 1.8 input templates retain native parts, states,
       IME, selection, reveal, query, spin and popup behavior. Visual-state
       brushes reference app palette keys directly, avoiding SDK gradients.
       Input templates own one accent focus border; system focus adorners are
